" again on 9/30 at a different site. That could be a reused number or a re-opened ticket, and I can't tell which from these sources. Newark is also where the 4/27 digest puts the Mobility depot, so check the 9/30 entry really belongs to the parent.\n- **#PD-8841 vs #8841:** I treated them as the same ticket because the numbers match. I haven't confirmed that.\n- **#PD-4418:** the digest only says \"the account Nadia runs\", not Vantorre. Nadia also ran other accounts then, so confirm it's Vantorre before counting it.\n- **Hartford tickets:** I haven't opened INC-4821 or VT-55120 or their attachments. I'm only reporting what Gideon wrote in the channel.\n- **8/3/26 digest:** the Hartford Sev 1 entry has no ticket number, so it adds nothing to the list.\n\nI left out #4812 (Vantorre Mobility, 3/10/25 digest) and #PD-4402 (Quillfeather, 9/15/25 digest). The 3/10/25, 7/7/25, 12/1/25 and 5/3/26 digests and the cheat sheet mention Vantorre but give no ticket numbers.\n\nI only read what you can see: #strategic-pod, #inc-vtg-hartford and the public digests. I didn't check the account ticket folders in the share, so there could be more tickets there. Let me know if you want me to look."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
